      "content": "Sabre Bargain Finder Max (BFM) API provides low-fare search capabilities for air shopping, returning optimal flight itineraries with pricing across Sabre's global airline content inventory. Supports one-way, round-trip, and multi-city searches with ATPCO, LCC, and NDC content.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Sabre Developer Support",
